        "Abstract": "Current research on hate speech analysis is typically oriented towards monolingual and single classification tasks. This paper presents a new multilingual hate speech analysis dataset for English, Hindi, Arabic, French, German, and Spanish languages for multiple domains of hate speech. The dataset is created as a multilingual resource to facilitate cross-lingual research and contains fine-grained labels for each hate sample per language."
